# Realtek Wi-Fi (kernel/comps/rtw88): the RTL8821CE's, RTL8822BE's,
# RTL8822CE's and RTL8723DE's firmware, the same on their USB adapters, and
# the RTL8812AU's and the RTL8821AU's (the RTL8811AU runs the latter) for
# their 8051 CPU (its licence is the Realtek one under Bluetooth below).
