# Broadcom FullMAC Wi-Fi over PCIe (kernel/comps/brcmfmac): every chip's
# firmware linux-firmware has and the regulatory (CLM) data of the chips
# that need it (the boards' NVRAM files, named after each board, are left
# out: a board whose NVRAM lives in its EFI variables needs it as
